Z||000009||KnightRyder31||11-25-2000||01:28 PM||||Fiero's don't have carb's.<BR>If it's a 4cyl, you have a TB-injected car.<BR>If you have a 6cyl, you a MPI.<BR>You obviously already knew that, didn't you?||||reg||1
